sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant App as React App
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant Lambda
    participant Cognito
    participant DB as DynamoDB

    User->>App: Enter email + password
    App->>API: POST /v1/auth/signup (no auth)
    API->>Lambda: Forward request
    Lambda->>Cognito: SignUpCommand (email + password)
    Cognito-->>Lambda: User created
    Lambda->>Cognito: AdminConfirmSignUpCommand
    Cognito-->>Lambda: User confirmed
    Lambda->>Cognito: InitiateAuthCommand (get tokens)
    Cognito-->>Lambda: Access + Refresh tokens
    Lambda->>DB: Create user record
    Note over DB: userId, email, 2000 Essence,<br/>0 Gems, loginStreak: 0
    Lambda-->>App: JWT tokens + user data
    App-->>User: Redirect to Totem Gallery
